s molestie at quisque sapien and integer congue magna\\\"\",\"_id\":\"4b13bdd\",\"name_item\":\"- Wendy T.\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Mauris donec ociis magnis sapien etiam sapien congue augue pretium and ligula augue a lectus magna suscipit egestas a vitae purus integer congue\\\"\",\"_id\":\"4f085ca\",\"name_item\":\"- Grace L.\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"An augue in cubilia laoreet magna and suscipit egestas magna ipsum purus an ipsum undo suscipit gravida donec and pretium ipsum porta integer\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- Michelle Boxer\",\"_id\":\"94c5c5a\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Mauris donec magnis a sapien etiam sapien and congue augue egestas ultrice vitae purus velna integer tempor congue egestas a vitae purus\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- Kelley Baker\",\"_id\":\"8c68960\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"An augue cubilia laoreet magna sapien suscipit undo egestas magna ipsum ligula vitae a purus cubilia a blandit and auctor integer congue magna undo justo purus pretium ligula efficitur ipsum\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- Sarah D.\",\"_id\":\"3421685\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Augue egestas volutpat undo egestas augue in cubilia laoreet magna at primis libero undo suscipit luctus congue magna undo purus pretium ligula rutrum\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"Nicole Byer\",\"_id\":\"e805a4a\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Aliquam augue a suscipit luctus neque purus ipsum neque dolor primis libero at tempus blandit posuere magna sagittis congue augue magna risus mauris and volutpat and egestas\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- AJ\",\"_id\":\"6a6b936\"}]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"bdevs-testimonials-section\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1e2fe5f\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7426073\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0da5acc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"id_section\":\"promo-4\",\"title\":\"La Notte\",\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"Slide #1\",\"tab_c