 congue augue egestas ultrice vitae purus velna integer tempor congue egestas a vitae purus\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- Kelley Baker\",\"_id\":\"8c68960\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"An augue cubilia laoreet magna sapien suscipit undo egestas magna ipsum ligula vitae a purus cubilia a blandit and auctor integer congue magna undo justo purus pretium ligula efficitur ipsum\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- Sarah D.\",\"_id\":\"3421685\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Augue egestas volutpat undo egestas augue in cubilia laoreet magna at primis libero undo suscipit luctus congue magna undo purus pretium ligula rutrum\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"Nicole Byer\",\"_id\":\"e805a4a\"},{\"text_item\":\"\\\"Aliquam augue a suscipit luctus neque purus ipsum neque dolor primis libero at tempus blandit posuere magna sagittis congue augue magna risus mauris and volutpat and egestas\\\"\",\"name_item\":\"- AJ\",\"_id\":\"6a6b936\"}]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"bdevs-testimonials-section\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1e2fe5f\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7426073\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0da5acc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"id_section\":\"promo-4\",\"title\":\"La Notte\",\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"Slide #1\",\"tab_content\":\"I am item content. Click edit button to change this text.\",\"_id\":\"ff9308b\",\"link_item\":\"\",\"text_item\":\"\"}],\"bg_left\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/shtheme.com\\/demosd\\/lanotte\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/05\\/pb_4-1.jpg\",\"id\":317,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"heading1\":\"A Brush Of Perfection\",\"title1\":\"Follow & Share\",\"link1\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/\",\"text1\":\"@la_notte_nail\",\"link_button1\":\"https:\\/\\/shtheme.com\\/demosd\\/lanotte\\/?page_id=88\",\"text_button1\":\"View Our Gallery\",\"heading2\":\"Make it happen\",\"title2\":\"Gift <sp